{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2021-04-20 06:30:00', 'title': 'KEYCORP REPORTS RECORD FIRST QUARTER 2021 NET INCOME OF $591 MILLION, OR $.61 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, APRIL\xa020, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEYCORP (NYSE: KEY) TODAY ANNOUNCED NET INCOME FROM CONTINUING OPERATIONS ATTRIBUTABLE TO KEY COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $591 MILLION, OR $.61 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2021. THIS COMPARED TO $549 MILLION, OR $.56 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE, FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2020 AND $118 MILLION, OR $.12 PER DILUTED COMMON SHARE, FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2020.'}